	"mihon": {
		"$comment": [
			"The only TEXT document this format publishes, and it is a trap: the",
			"deprecated index.min.json, whose two rows exist to tell an old reader to",
			"update. Its shape is identical to the sibling format's real index, which",
			"is why the adapter answers with a sentence rather than declining, and why",
			"it is asked first. The real index is a gzipped protobuf and is built in",
			"mihon.spec.ts rather than stored here."
		],
